","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"XyunkhTKBteNo0Sbap8R3g","review_id":"eYnolYjDAZ7vEL_C_3xzSQ","date":"2016-01-05T02:22:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9271318316459656,"text_excerpt":"Very happy I tried La Mansion tonight. Fast, courteous service. The margarita was strong and fresh- no mix! The house chips and salsa were wonderfully fresh and I appreciated the roasted flavor of the salsa. Was able to try the chicken, ground beef and shrimp for the taco plate. The proteins were all well cooked and seasoned. I am a fan of tacos only dressed in cilantro and onion (if the meat is well seasoned I don't need it hidden under cheese) but I can see fast food fans being confused. What I didn't expect was that the rice and beans sides would be so tasty and a wonderful compliment to the meal. I am looking forward to trying more dishes on my next visit."},{"business_id":"XyunkhTKBteNo0Sbap8R3g","review_id":"e0iNEkoa7ya9riydCFVjfg","date":"2019-07-29T20:35:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9265824556350708,"text_excerpt":"Delicious Mexican Food. Salsa, Guac, Suisa Enchiladas, Carne Asada Tacos, Tamales, you name it! Handcrafted margaritas! I'd eat here once a week if this was in Mid-City. So instead I eat here about every 10-14 days. We love the owner/manager/chef. They are friendly, accommodating, and engaging. If you are looking for a better Mexican spot stop by here. You may find your new \"go to\"!"},{"business_id":"XyunkhTKBteNo0Sbap8R3g","review_id":"Gucf1rA6PcixF7901FPX5w","date":"2018-10-04T19:47:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.926170289516449,"text_excerpt":"I've driven by this place plenty of times and never noticed it. A coworker suggested we go for lunch today and it was really good. I love the chips and how brown and crunchy they are. The salsa was good and spicy. I had the beef enchiladas, which were great and the rice and beans with it were yummy too. Very good and quick service. I'll definitely have to come back."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"XyunkhTKBteNo0Sbap8R3g","photo_id":"_wXTARsPYn797X_E0Ordsg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_wXTARsPYn797X_E0Ordsg.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
